{"page":503,"verses":[{"verse_key":"46:6","surah":46,"ayah":6,"ar_uthmani":"وَإِذَا حُشِرَ ٱلنَّاسُ كَانُوا۟ لَهُمْ أَعْدَآءً وَكَانُوا۟ بِعِبَادَتِهِمْ كَـٰفِرِينَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"those who, when all mankind is gathered, will become his enemies and disown his worship?","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَإِذَا","en_gloss":"And when","transliteration":"wa-idhā","verse_key":"46:6"},{"pos":2,"ar":"حُشِرَ","en_gloss":"are gathered","transliteration":"ḥushira","verse_key":"46:6"},{"pos":3,"ar":"ٱلنَّاسُ","en_gloss":"the people","transliteration":"l-nāsu","verse_key":"46:6"},{"pos":4,"ar":"كَانُوا۟","en_gloss":"they will be","transliteration":"kānū","verse_key":"46:6"},{"pos":5,"ar":"لَهُمْ","en_gloss":"for them","transliteration":"lahum","verse_key":"46:6"},{"pos":6,"ar":"أَعْدَآءًۭ","en_gloss":"enemies","transliteration":"aʿdāan","verse_key":"46:6"},{"pos":7,"ar":"وَكَانُوا۟","en_gloss":"and they will be","transliteration":"wakānū","verse_key":"46:6"},{"pos":8,"ar":"بِعِبَادَتِهِمْ","en_gloss":"of their worship","transliteration":"biʿibādatihim","verse_key":"46:6"},{"pos":9,"ar":"كَـٰفِرِينَ","en_gloss":"deniers","transliteration":"kāfirīna","verse_key":"46:6"},{"pos":10,"ar":"٦","en_gloss":"(6)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"46:6"}]},{"verse_key":"46:7","surah":46,"ayah":7,"ar_uthmani":"وَإِذَا تُتْلَىٰ عَلَيْهِمْ ءَايَـٰتُنَا بَيِّنَـٰتٍ قَالَ ٱلَّذِينَ كَفَرُوا۟ لِلْحَقِّ لَمَّا جَآءَهُمْ هَـٰذَا سِحْرٌ مُّبِينٌ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"When Our revelations are recited to them in all their clarity, the disbelievers say of the Truth that has reached them, ‘This is clearly sorcery,’","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَإِذَا","en_gloss":"And when","transliteration":"wa-idhā","verse_key":"46:7"},{"pos":2,"ar":"تُتْلَىٰ","en_gloss":"are recited","transliteration":"tut'lā","verse_key":"46:7"},{"pos":3,"ar":"عَلَيْهِمْ","en_gloss":"to them","transliteration":"ʿalayhim","verse_key":"46:7"},{"pos":4,"ar":"ءَايَـٰتُنَا","en_gloss":"Our Verses","transliteration":"āyātun